flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9139778Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9140196Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9140629Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9140835Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9141041Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9141927Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9142189Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9142386Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9142653Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9142777Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9143038Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9143371Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9143697Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9143922Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9144023Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9144203Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9144349Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9144482Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9144800Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9144887Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9144968Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9145094Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9147954Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9148400Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9154393Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9154521Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9154844Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9155051Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9155420Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9155881Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9156247Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9156485Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9156734Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9157121Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9157468Z    /root
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9167214Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9167899Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9175950Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T11:58:35.9176435Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
